{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2021-12-06 16:22:00', 'title': 'RAYMOND JAMES LTD. CHAIRMAN AND CEO PAUL ALLISON STEPPING DOWN', 'text': "ST. PETERSBURG, FLA., DEC. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- RAYMOND JAMES LTD. (RJL) CHAIRMAN AND CEO PAUL ALLISON, HEAD OF RAYMOND JAMES' (NYSE: RJF) CANADIAN SUBSIDIARY, HAS NOTIFIED THE FIRM OF HIS INTENTION TO STEP DOWN FROM HIS POSITION AS EXECUTIVE OFFICER EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 31, 2021. HE WILL TRANSITION TO THE NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF RJL EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN TO PROVIDE STRATEGIC GUIDANCE TO THE MANAGEMENT TEAM AND SERVE IN A SENIOR CLIENT RELATIONSHIP CAPACITY."}{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2021-12-06 16:18:00', 'title': 'RAYMOND JAMES PRESIDENT JOHN CARSON TO RETIRE', 'text': 'ST. PETERSBURG, FLA., DEC. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ON DECEMBER 2, 2021, RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL (NYSE: RJF) PRESIDENT JOHN CARSON NOTIFIED THE FIRM THAT HE INTENDS TO RETIRE AS PRESIDENT EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 31, 2021, AND REMAIN WITH THE FIRM AS VICE CHAIRMAN TO ENSURE A SUCCESSFUL TRANSITION OF RESPONSIBILITIES.'}